 "notes": "48x48 for dialogue, 32x32 for menus; both include a 1 px bevel frame and their own dark backdrop. E2-sprites: elian, anwen, tovin, lena, aurel (W12: SDF renders, chars/portraits_w12.py), nameless_king (the veiled King), and vex (Vex Quill: the silver_rogue frames). W11: nameless_king and nameless_king_unmasked are 1x crops of the battle frames. E3-sprites: ilya is the goggles_smith frames (alias); cinder_warden is a 1x crop of the Molten Shell battle frame (head, halo and lit furnace grate). There is no veyra portrait: the SDF renderer reaches only the Episode 2 tier, which does not match the Episode 1 painted set side by side."
